# vpn's own network settings, run at every boot (netlab's network file).
# Its tunnel interface to the provider: a VTI. Whatever is routed into it
# is marked with its key and encrypted by the IPsec SA that carries the
# same mark. Each ___ is a value still to fill in.
ip link add vti0 type vti local 198.51.100.10 remote 203.0.113.10 key ___
ip addr add ___ dev vti0
ip link set vti0 up
